# Each capture of experiments.spec.ts beside its frame of the approved
# prototype .superpowers/sdd/experiments-prototype.html: <frame id>.png is
# that file rendered at the capture's 1280px viewport, dark, in the same
# state -- the open experiment selected, the closed one selected, the first
# chart point hovered, then focused.
experiments-open.png experiments-prototype-open
experiments-closed.png experiments-prototype-closed
experiments-hover.png experiments-prototype-hover
experiments-focus.png experiments-prototype-focus
